// QNMF Pillar 6: ECRA Adaptive Compute Router
// Architecture: 129 inputs (128-dim query embedding x_t + 1-dim uncertainty u_t)
// Hidden: 64 neurons (ReLU)
// Output: 4 logits -> Softmax {Level 0, Level 1, Level 2, Level 3}

network EcraRouterNet ⟦
    dense ⟬129⸴ 64⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬64⸴ 4⟭ ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    emit "ECRA_ROUTER_SPEC_INITIALIZED" ·
    yield 0 ·
⟧
